WEBVTT

00:00:08.474 --> 00:00:09.114
[laughs] Wow.

00:00:09.114 --> 00:00:12.594
Only Sonic the Hedgehog
could win a dance battle
that epic.

00:00:13.034 --> 00:00:14.034
Well,
stick with me, pal.

00:00:14.253 --> 00:00:15.614
Earth can be
a scary place,

00:00:15.694 --> 00:00:18.114
but I know everything
about this old pale blue dot.

00:00:18.413 --> 00:00:19.833
Do you really mean that?

00:00:20.193 --> 00:00:23.853
I mean, not everything.
But I watch a lot of
Discovery Channel and--

00:00:23.853 --> 00:00:26.213
I meant about
me being your pal.

00:00:28.253 --> 00:00:29.253
Of course, buddy.

00:00:32.013 --> 00:00:34.033
[laughs]
Comin' in hot.

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.214
Growing up,
I didn't have
any friends.

00:00:37.774 --> 00:00:40.174
Everyone in my village
thought my two tails
were weird.

00:00:40.654 --> 00:00:42.374
Hey,
I know that feeling.

00:00:42.553 --> 00:00:45.874
But then I saw you,
the fastest creature
in the galaxy.

00:00:46.654 --> 00:00:49.974
You were weird too.
But you were a legend.

00:00:50.834 --> 00:00:54.033
That made me think,
maybe being weird
isn't so bad.

00:00:54.714 --> 00:00:57.654
You inspired me
to leave my village,

00:00:57.894 --> 00:00:59.934
to find you and help you
in your mission.

00:01:01.374 --> 00:01:02.794
I'm really glad
you're here, Tails.

00:01:03.674 --> 00:01:05.114
I'm glad I'm here too,
Sonic.

00:01:10.222 --> 00:01:12.060
[both yawn]

00:01:12.194 --> 00:01:14.013
Well, might as well
get some sleep.

00:01:14.513 --> 00:01:16.294
This feels like
a good place
to spend the night.

00:01:16.674 --> 00:01:18.614
You'll be able to get
clear readings
on your gizmo thing

00:01:18.614 --> 00:01:20.334
once the storm is over,
so I-- [sighs]

00:01:21.075 --> 00:01:23.683
[snoring]

00:01:32.524 --> 00:01:33.524
Night, Tails.

00:01:44.105 --> 00:01:46.313
[yawning]

00:01:46.427 --> 00:01:47.759
[gasps]

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:50.734
Tails. Tails.
We have a situation.
[snoring]

00:01:56.576 --> 00:01:58.066
[Sonic] Hoo-hoo!

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:00.863
Today's forecast calls for
clear, sunny skies

00:02:00.863 --> 00:02:03.843
and a 100% chance
of adventure.
[device beeping]

00:02:04.144 --> 00:02:06.943
I pinpointed
the coordinates.
It's right up ahead.

00:02:09.375 --> 00:02:10.747
[Sonic] Wow.

00:02:20.823 --> 00:02:22.204
Hey, Tails.
Wait up.

00:02:24.403 --> 00:02:25.403
Whoa.

00:02:28.104 --> 00:02:31.844
Okay, we got
a giant owl door.
Seems encouraging.

00:02:38.351 --> 00:02:39.751
[grunts]

00:02:43.184 --> 00:02:44.184
Whoa.

00:02:44.329 --> 00:02:45.465
[gasps]

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:46.584
Check this out.

00:02:46.704 --> 00:02:48.004
Can you
translate that?

00:02:48.664 --> 00:02:49.664
Uh, yeah.

00:02:51.124 --> 00:02:54.004
[Tails] Ages ago,
a fearsome group of warriors,

00:02:54.004 --> 00:02:55.464
known as the Echidnas,

00:02:55.904 --> 00:02:58.004
forged the Seven Chaos Emeralds

00:02:58.004 --> 00:03:01.424
into the most
unstoppable weapon
ever created.

00:03:05.073 --> 00:03:06.593
The Master Emerald.

00:03:07.074 --> 00:03:09.354
With it, a single warrior

00:03:09.354 --> 00:03:11.554
could defeat entire armies.

00:03:11.999 --> 00:03:14.205
[screams]

00:03:14.574 --> 00:03:16.594
[Tails] Believing no one should
have such power,

00:03:17.734 --> 00:03:20.273
an order of heroes
recovered the Emerald

00:03:20.773 --> 00:03:22.874
and swore to protect it
from evil.

00:03:24.534 --> 00:03:26.253
Sounds like
the Owls and the Echidnas

00:03:26.253 --> 00:03:27.974
have been fighting
each other for centuries.

00:03:28.573 --> 00:03:30.513
Like Vin Diesel
and The Rock.

00:03:32.193 --> 00:03:33.213
[gasps] Whoa!
Wait for me.

00:03:40.553 --> 00:03:44.293
Okay, giant owl door,
giant owl. Makes sense.

00:03:44.944 --> 00:03:46.724
Whoa.

00:03:55.524 --> 00:03:58.324
Wait a second.
I've seen these symbols before.

00:04:02.993 --> 00:04:04.053
Here we go.

00:04:08.826 --> 00:04:10.777
[rumbling]

00:04:12.624 --> 00:04:13.724
Well, that did something.

